<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam inflation stable at 4.4 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Vietnam inflation stable at 4.4 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicators on Monday:</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES		 Jan 97     Dec 96     Jan96</p>
<p> Month-on-month percentage change     +0.8	 +1.0	 +0.9</p>
<p> Year-on-year percentage change	 +4.4	 +4.5	 +9.8</p>
<p> Index (base 100 = prev. Dec)	  100.8	104.5	100.9</p>
</text>
